This updates component styles to enforce a single SCSS contract across the library: every component now defines a component prefix in `_variables.scss`, and every `index.scss` root block follows the same selector/mixin scaffold. The goal is consistent token naming and predictable shared behavior across all atoms/molecules/organisms.

- **Contract alignment (`_variables.scss`)**
  - Added `$css-ui-component-prefix: globals.$css-ui-prefix + $css-ui-component-name + '-';` to all component `_variables.scss` files.
  - Added missing globals wiring where needed so component variable modules consistently expose shared prefix/class variables.

- **Root block normalization (`index.scss`)**
  - Standardized root selectors to:
    - `%#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}#{vars.$css-ui-component-name},`
    - `.#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}#{vars.$css-ui-component-name} { ... }`
  - Normalized root-level token/layout mixins to use `vars.$css-ui-component-prefix` (instead of component-name-based interpolation).
  - Ensured the shared root scaffold is present in each component:
    - `generate-vars(...)`
    - `base-layout(...)`
    - `elevation-generator(2)`
    - `elevation-transition()`
    - `transition-properties(..., var(--#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}duration))`

- **Representative pattern after change**
  ```scss
  // _variables.scss
  @use '../../../_generics/variables' as globals;
  @forward '../../../_generics/variables';

  $css-ui-component-name: 'example-component' !default;
  $css-ui-component-prefix: globals.$css-ui-prefix + $css-ui-component-name + '-';

  // index.scss
  %#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}#{vars.$css-ui-component-name},
  .#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}#{vars.$css-ui-component-name} {
    @include generics.generate-vars($component-color-map, vars.$css-ui-component-prefix);
    @include generics.base-layout(vars.$css-ui-component-prefix);
    @include generics.elevation-generator(2);
    @include generics.elevation-transition();
    @include generics.transition-properties(
      (box-shadow, transform, opacity, background, color, border),
      var(--#{vars.$css-ui-class-prefix}duration)
    );
  }
  ```
